# Layout ladder, step 5 (plan/20-core-domain/29-layout-ladder.md): the primary on the exchanger's second side.

fluidscript 1
circuit ladder
fluid water

NPS  inlet t=85 p=600
NPR  outlet p=350
PCV  valve
PP   pipe length=12 dn=25

PU1  pump
HE1  heat_exchanger power=30 in=20 out=50 in2=85 out2=45
LOAD heat_exchanger power=-30
CV1  valve

connections
NPS - PCV - PP - HE1.in2
HE1.out2 - NPR

PU1 - HE1.in
HE1.out - LOAD
LOAD - CV1
CV1 - PU1
